title: XenServer / XCP-ng: VM guest tools
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check monitors whether the guest tools of a running VM report to XAPI.
 It goes {WARN} (configurable) if no guest metrics are available or the PV
 drivers are not detected. The guest tools version is shown. Data comes from
 the special agent {agent_xenserver}.

discovery:
 One service {XenServer VM Guest Tools} per VM.
